# Hellcat, Undying Vigilante: "When Hellcat dies, return her to the battlefield under her owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on
# her. She loses all abilities and gains haste."
# Bot2 kills the 2/2 Hellcat with Lightning Bolt. She returns, untapped, with a +1/+1 counter (a 3/3, CR 122.6) and with haste
# only: she lost her printed Haste and the dying trigger, then gained haste, which comes later (CR 613.1f, 613.7). So a second
# Lightning Bolt, now killing the 3/3, finds no trigger: she stays in the graveyard (she would return a second time as a 4/4 if the
# ability had stayed). Haste is shown by her not being summoning sick as a new object.
# Mox Emerald pays {G}{G}; Mox Ruby pays each Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Hellcat, Undying Vigilante
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
